      "filename": "Pockmarked sands, Nanjizal beach - geograph.org.uk - 526253.jpg",
      "title": "File:Pockmarked sands, Nanjizal beach - geograph.org.uk - 526253.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/Pockmarked_sands%2C_Nanjizal_beach_-_geograph.org.uk_-_526253.jpg",
